          <choice_text>19</choice_text>
          <commentary>102.4/3.2 = 32 = 2⁵이므로 5 × 3.8 = 19일이어서 정답이다.</commentary>
        </choice_explanation>
        <choice_explanation no="3" is_answer="false" judgment="[X]">
          <choice_text>22.8</choice_text>
          <commentary>22.8일은 반감기 6번에 해당한다.</commentary>
