    </question_explanation>
    <question_explanation no="16" id="PRB-9DD2BB0E0131148B-Q16">
      <question_stem>다음은 25 °C, 표준상태에서 일어나는 열화학 반응이다. 25 °C에서 C_(2)H_(2)($g$)의 표준 연소열($\triangle$H^(o))[kcal]은?</question_stem>
      <question_type polarity="긍정형(옳은/적절한 것 고르기)" category="핵심 개념·이론 이해형" />
      <topic_keywords>
        <keyword>표준상태에서</keyword>
        <keyword>일어나</keyword>
        <keyword>열화학</keyword>
        <keyword>반응이다</keyword>
      </topic_keywords>
      <answer_info>
        <correct_answer>1</correct_answer>
        <correct_choice_text>－323</correct_choice_text>
        <answer_source>정답표</answer_source>
      </answer_info>
      <overall_commentary>출제 영역: 화학 · 헤스 법칙
정답은 ①이다. C₂H₂ + 5/2O₂ → 2CO₂ + H₂O(l)의 ΔH° = 2 × (-98) + (-68) - 59 = -196 - 68 - 59 = -323 kcal이다.</overall_commentary>
      <choice_explanations>
        <choice_explanation no="1" is_answer="true" judgment="[O] (정답)">
          <choice_text>－323</choice_text>
          <commentary>ΔH° = 2(-98) + (-68) - 59 = -323 kcal이므로 정답이다.</commentary>
        </choice_explanation>
        <choice_explanation no="2" is_answer="false" judgment="[X]">
          <choice_text>－225</choice_text>
          <commentary>-225 kcal은 계산값과 다르다.</commentary>
        </choice_explanation>
        <choice_explanation no="3" is_answer="false" judgment="[X]">
          <choice_text>－205</choice_text>
          <commentary>-205 kcal은 생성열 59를 더한 값과 관련되어 옳지 않다.</commentary>
        </choice_explanation>
        <choice_explanation no="4" is_answer="false" judgment="[X]">
          <choice_text>－107</choice_text>
          <commentary>-107 kcal은 계산값과 다르다.</commentary>
        </choice_explanation>
      </choice_explanations>
