    <question_explanation no="17" id="PRB-9DD2BB0E0131148B-Q17">
      <question_stem>일정한 온도와 압력에서 10 mol의 전자가 전위차 1.5 V인 전지에서 가역적으로 이동할 때, $\left| \triangle G \right|$[kJ]는? (단, $G$는 Gibbs 에너지이고, Faraday 상수는 96,000 C mol^(-1)이다)</question_stem>
      <question_type polarity="긍정형(옳은/적절한 것 고르기)" category="핵심 개념·이론 이해형" />
      <topic_keywords>
        <keyword>일정한</keyword>
        <keyword>온도와</keyword>
        <keyword>압력에서</keyword>
        <keyword>전자</keyword>
      </topic_keywords>
      <answer_info>
        <correct_answer>3</correct_answer>
        <correct_choice_text>1.44 × 10^(3)</correct_choice_text>
        <answer_source>정답표</answer_source>
      </answer_info>
      <overall_commentary>출제 영역: 화학 · 깁스 에너지와 기전력
정답은 ③이다. |ΔG| = nFE = 10 × 96,000 × 1.5 = 1.44 × 10⁶ J = 1.44 × 10³ kJ이다.</overall_commentary>
      <choice_explanations>
        <choice_explanation no="1" is_answer="false" judgment="[X]">
          <choice_text>1.44 × 10^(-3)</choice_text>
          <commentary>1.44 × 10⁻³ kJ은 단위 환산을 잘못한 값이다.</commentary>
        </choice_explanation>
        <choice_explanation no="2" is_answer="false" judgment="[X]">
          <choice_text>1.44</choice_text>
          <commentary>1.44 kJ은 단위 환산을 잘못한 값이다.</commentary>
        </choice_explanation>
        <choice_explanation no="3" is_answer="true" judgment="[O] (정답)">
          <choice_text>1.44 × 10^(3)</choice_text>
          <commentary>|ΔG| = 10 × 96,000 × 1.5 = 1.44 × 10⁶ J = 1.44 × 10³ kJ이므로 정답이다.</commentary>
        </choice_explanation>
        <choice_explanation no="4" is_answer="false" judgment="[X]">
          <choice_text>1.44 × 10^(6)</choice_text>
          <commentary>1.44 × 10⁶ kJ은 J 단위의 값을 kJ로 잘못 적은 것이다.</commentary>
        </choice_explanation>
      </choice_explanations>
